# Courier Route Simulation – Cursor Prompt

## Goal
Simulate the full courier delivery journey: start route, navigate, confirm delivery, auto-advance, and visualize progress.

## Steps
1. On dashboard, show “Ready for Next Delivery?” with customer/address.
2. Clicking “Start Route” opens an interactive map modal with:
   - Current location, destination, optimal route.
   - Option to open in Google Maps/Waze/Apple Maps.
3. On arrival, require:
   - Barcode scan (mock input)
   - Photo upload (mock)
   - “Confirm Delivery” button
4. On success, auto-advance to next stop and repeat.
5. Show progress bar/stepper for route completion.
6. Provide simulation controls for dev/test (auto-complete, skip, fail).
7. All UI: shadcn/ui + Tailwind, accessible, responsive.

## Acceptance
- Each delivery step is interactive and testable.
- Map and navigation are visually clear.
- Delivery cannot be confirmed without barcode and photo.
- Progress and next stop always visible.
- Simulation controls available for rapid testing.

## Edge Cases
- Barcode mismatch, photo fail, GPS fail, all complete.
